{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"9343bfa8f312632d1ca440a343bb8f3113df35e53727dcc88d3b01c1b91b7379","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM provider abstraction layer and architectural decision documentation","key_entities":["providers.py","bedrock_model.py","anthropic_model.py","capabilities.py","ModelProfile","provider_factory hook","provider_provenance","KNOWN_PROVIDER_NAMES","docs/llm-framework.md","docs/adr/0059-llm-provider-seam-and-support-tiers.md"],"problem_keywords":["provider seam","two-tier support policy","LLM framework documentation","Bedrock integration","pydantic-ai provider_factory","verdict provenance","prompt caching"],"propositions":["ADR 0059 documents the pydantic-ai provider_factory seam and two-tier (first_class/best_effort) support policy with rejected alternatives and evidence.","The provider seam uses pydantic-ai's provider_factory hook as a per-run SESSION object, with native Bedrock + Anthropic as first-class and OpenAI-compatible as best-effort.","Capability decisions are derived from ModelProfile field presence (prompt_cache_style, native_structured_output, supports_thinking, supports_temperature), never from provider-name strings.","Verdicts are stamped with provider_provenance (provider, model, endpoint_host, tier, capabilities) as an additive backward-compatible payload on every tier, with tier determined by registry membership and base_url presence.","docs/llm-framework.md provider section and environment-variable table require correction to reflect native Bedrock support, tier definitions, and actual config defaults (MAX_TOKENS=16000, MAX_ITERATIONS=250)."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1786708421750969001,"uuid":"b663ffdc-c800-4a73-9e35-394261e55a19"}